@startuml SD-5a
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-5a (Software level, CSMS) — Admin registers a Charge Point, the Operator onboards it to a station\nPrecondition: Admin / Operator staff logged in · System view: AD-8 · State: STM-3
footer Owner: Trần Đức Ân (WP1) · v2.1 · 10/11/2026 · names = code after the Charge Point rename (T90) · HTTP routes «planned»: the service is driven by tests and the demo for now · left gate = Admin console / Operator Dashboard

participant "«component»\n<u>:ChargePointOnboardingService</u>" as POS
participant "«component»\n<u>:ChargePointLifecyclePolicy</u>" as PLP

== Admin registers the serial ==
[-> POS ++ : registerDevice(adminId, {serial, model})\n(POST /admin/charge-points «planned» [HTTPS, JWT admin])
POS -> POS : requireRole(admin), check serial is new
break serial already registered
  [<-- POS : 409 "duplicate serial"
end
POS -> PLP ++ : transition(null, REGISTER) : ChargePointLifecycle
PLP --> POS -- : registered
POS -> POS : save Charge Point
hnote over POS : {chargePoint.lifecycle = registered}
[<-- POS -- : 201 {chargePointId}

== Operator onboards it to one of its stations ==
[-> POS ++ : onboard(staffId, {serial, siteId, connectors})\n(POST /operator/charge-points «planned» [HTTPS, JWT operator])
POS -> POS : operatorOf(staffId), check site belongs to that Operator,\nserial registered, 1–2 connectors
break site of another Operator, serial not registered or already onboarded
  [<-- POS : 403 / 404 / 409, nothing saved
end
POS -> PLP ++ : transition(registered, ONBOARD) : ChargePointLifecycle
PLP --> POS -- : awaiting_connection
POS -> POS : link site, create connectors (Unavailable),\ngenerate credential, store its hash
hnote over POS : {chargePoint.lifecycle = awaiting_connection}
[<-- POS -- : 201 {ocppUrl, credential}
note right of POS : the credential is shown once;\nthe Operator enters it on the\nCharge Point (SD-5b)
@enduml
